    "detailed_description": "Hovercar racing, laser shooting, fully motion controlled madness! RacetronicVR is a time trail racing game where you shoot obstacles and powerups, built exclusively for VR.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steer with one hand and shoot with the other. VR racing as it should be: with motion controllers. <br></li><li>3 galactic tracks with a bevy of obstacles, shortcuts, power ups and secrets keep the good times racing. <br></li><li>Local leader boards for track times, become the fastest racer in the galaxy.<br></li><li>Can cause VR motion sickness for some people, but hey, it's free :D</li></ul><br>Thanks for playing, I hope you enjoy!",
    "about_the_game": "Hovercar racing, laser shooting, fully motion controlled madness! RacetronicVR is a time trail racing game where you shoot obstacles and powerups, built exclusively for VR.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Steer with one hand and shoot with the other. VR racing as it should be: with motion controllers. <br></li><li>3 galactic tracks with a bevy of obstacles, shortcuts, power ups and secrets keep the good times racing. <br></li><li>Local leader boards for track times, become the fastest racer in the galaxy.<br></li><li>Can cause VR motion sickness for some people, but hey, it's free :D</li></ul><br>Thanks for playing, I hope you enjoy!",
